# Keep Out's first mode deals exactly 4 damage: Bot2's Aegis Turtle (0/5) attacks on turn 4 and is tapped, and Keep Out leaves it
# alive with 4 damage marked, not 3 or 5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Keep Out
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Aegis Turtle
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Aegis Turtle.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Aegis Turtle > Bot1)
